  "id": "3/G",
  "goal": "Explain the main application domains of augmented reality and classify AR systems into marker-based and markerless categories.",
  "achieves": "It gives the learner a foundation for understanding what AR applications are for and how they are technically distinguished, which supports later XR hardware/software analysis and system development."
 },
 "objectives": [
  {
