   "goal": "Explain the main application domains of augmented reality and illustrate them with examples from consumer/customer experience and healthcare, emphasizing augmentation of real-world content rather than immersion.",
   "achieves": "It helps the learner recognize where AR is used and what user tasks it supports, which prepares them to gather requirements and evaluate use cases for an XR system.",
